{"id": "EUVD-2026-76137", "enisaUuid": "3faf8d92-135a-3da5-9b66-88d9e7206af9", "description": "MoguBlog through 6.2 fails to validate the comment author identity in the POST /web/comment/add endpoint, allowing authenticated users to post comments attributed to any other user. Attackers can supply arbitrary userUid values in the request body to impersonate other accounts including administrators.", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T15:25:18", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-24T14:21:40", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/LinYuanyi1/cve-request-poc/blob/master/mogublog-poc/C12_comment_add_author_spoof.py", "https://github.com/moxi624/mogu_blog_v2/blob/025d78c7ac7e19b1abf796fa3cc158d855723d15/mogu_web/src/main/java/com/moxi/mogublog/web/restapi/CommentRestApi.java", "https://gitee.com/moxi159753/mogu_blog_v2/releases", "https://github.com/moxi624/mogu_blog_v2", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mogublog-through-6.2-comment-author-spoofing-via-request-body-identity"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89264", "GHSA-7hrx-vv78-95j8"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.37, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "a8828a57-889e-3fd4-b63a-fe01aeedcb71", "product": {"name": "MoguBlog", "vendor": {"name": "moxi624"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22646.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c42d7a9f-2677-32c2-8e11-4ccebb3e32c1", "vendor": {"name": "moxi624"}}], "isExploited": false}